<p>Freeze damage claims in San Marcos do not come every year, but when they do they arrive all at once. Plumbing in attics, exterior walls, and garages was not designed for days below freezing, and a single cracked fitting can soak drywall, flooring, and cabinets before anyone notices. As a <a href="/">public adjuster in San Marcos</a>, we help owners deal with burst pipes, ice-related roof and tree damage, and the specific policy conditions that make freeze claims different from other water losses.</p>

